{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/9r7n9l39akuy8r0x79d8aridk6mo7qr.mp3","text":"轮到我值日吗……明白了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/h9thgrwhpf180nxsfms249aeqgsyqi8.mp3","text":"协助教学……虽然以前没做过，希望能做好。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/tosbz09c2riqyh5fe89wmga1aei2lzp.mp3","text":"……博士，是有烦恼吗？之前也有人和我说过，老师的工作压力很大……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/1nr6cw2uazzir5gtkjlmajiqg9jeotq.mp3","text":"我没有一放学就回宿舍。前天我去了闲逛部，昨天在莱娜老师的疗养庭院，今天答应了隔壁班同学去看改装铳……不过，还不知道那位同学的名字。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/44co495l89sxoryu1d85bso1hhqzkf8.mp3","text":"……博士好像很忙碌，一直有人来找你。有什么我能帮忙的吗？……这样啊，我明白了。那我就待在这里好了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/f1tpojvo8p6cpw89vai63oe68ufpnir.mp3","text":"如果能一直待在拉特兰吗？执行者的工作也许会很有趣……志愿实践的时候，如果能去公证所实习，说不定也不错。不过，还有更重要的事。同伴们还在等着我们回去。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/91xvtnmftj2438f9knn92p1y45c91iz.mp3","text":"博士，一会儿有空吗？我答应了里凯莱先生和他去新开的餐厅……我们聊到，或许也可以邀请博士一起，听说完成指定套餐的挑战可以免单。你有兴趣吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/22974g7ujmds8vtcr16zbywgfxkldg9.mp3","text":"还好，这个随身听在这里也能工作……博士想听？也可以……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/5yvv89cx3vcuk5ut4d1b9eqm8env1e2.mp3","text":"我好像渐渐习惯拉特兰了，现在即使看到人们吃着冰淇淋爆破泡芙雕像也不会惊讶了。也许是因为同伴们在身边，就会安心吧……而且，也遇到了新的同伴。博士，多谢你一直以来的照顾。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/p150s696bwctkqgssk76pqyeqo4bji9.mp3","text":"……拉特兰春天的阳光，把屋子照得暖洋洋的了啊。真舒服呢。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/p282oakkcw8wjj3fgomdgsqf0w52aj7.mp3","text":"我是结城理。刚转学过来，还不太了解情况……请和我讲讲这里的事吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/002w1rjbtd0nkrqczg8c4u60d27ov9k.mp3","text":"博士，不是说看你收藏的电影吗……好多戍卫队，还有铳骑，这些都是真的吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/qo1pu4ch9qrihsut5wu9krvc3z0131v.mp3","text":"我要提前升入高年级了吗……？啊，原来不是。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/dvw72e72qnexsr4mgihyd7jowei5ved.mp3","text":"这是……成为主力的意思吗？要是之后有机会参加大赛就好了。谢谢你的信任，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/j3lwenxirm0vw7vprwecx1xsce792n2.mp3","text":"战斗训练吗？明白了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/1qxena6lu4qd804ojp6nh84s1dz22ve.mp3","text":"交给我吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/choz6brqjhpblksqvfxfj170n5bno6p.mp3","text":"博士会为我们导航吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/n9i69lu4mqxd6ahwz9ed9imq81vabhj.mp3","text":"博士，拜托了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/ful5t6okfxexm9f28ybpdjqo9pq7ia0.mp3","text":"那么……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/4kofmytg5qrvu9kfnlyv6cbuhcb3aqd.mp3","text":"要怎么做。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/dpvszsvbmle6lvwp7j57hvudslr8uoz.mp3","text":"就是这里。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/swt9669kas0zm84yy97fy79jagbuzdn.mp3","text":"目前安全。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/5h7y3kfu5tmt60ne9vuhf4i8crlgwpu.mp3","text":"Persona！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/ljtftulcfj1dsjx6n9pncf2jmgao2ub.mp3","text":"来吧！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/gdci7tosx85wp6dw166mnt000d83lwe.mp3","text":"不会这样结束！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/t2ggfxadv4pqw7bycfilum7a5mzs0e2.mp3","text":"我……不会逃避！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/gbf1aik40at770q8xo35pp67urjqpep.mp3","text":"如此艰难的战斗……博士，你似乎也不会恐惧呢。不过，你一定和之前的我不一样吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/ix1l1jxw0xj2th6r1fbauyz12cuuofv.mp3","text":"赢了。由博士来指挥，就可以专注于战斗了。还不错。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/mwxarbnne7u0xowgu5vnb9de6szma8l.mp3","text":"总觉得还有资源没有收集……博士，确认已经探索完毕了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/10nphuv42ty0gcbc5t1gzam5tmskgfo.mp3","text":"现在还是撤退吧。勉力战斗可不好。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/qm9c1p7qqem1wm3u85wwdq5t9bydxwq.mp3","text":"我来了。这是博士你要我带的炸弹甜甜圈。……好吃吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/aiadxk855apf0gfktlk9ctznwkvp5bd.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/i8ey69syq3ecpobe0n97rhrcc80uqwx.mp3","text":"怎么了，博士？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/ocxqv6fr8lwygi20mlr4mt2my618lqf.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/k1nkiyby0vdqlqhlx13n98ogsz48344.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。新的一年，如果能再前进一些就好了。你和许多人都在为了某个美好的未来而努力吧……我们也会为此尽力的。今年，也请多关照。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/ap1gw2dl8ixbq8v3d2vywz3fe5phchf.mp3","text":"老师好……不，博士，你好。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/9r7n9l39akuy8r0x79d8aridk6mo7qr.mp3","text":"轮到我值日吗……明白了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/h9thgrwhpf180nxsfms249aeqgsyqi8.mp3","text":"协助教学……虽然以前没做过，希望能做好。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/tosbz09c2riqyh5fe89wmga1aei2lzp.mp3","text":"……博士，是有烦恼吗？之前也有人和我说过，老师的工作压力很大……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/1nr6cw2uazzir5gtkjlmajiqg9jeotq.mp3","text":"我没有一放学就回宿舍。前天我去了闲逛部，昨天在莱娜老师的疗养庭院，今天答应了隔壁班同学去看改装铳……不过，还不知道那位同学的名字。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3d/44co495l89sxoryu1d85bso1hhqzkf8.mp3","text":"……博士好像很忙碌，一直有人来找你。有什么我能帮忙的吗？……这样啊，我明白了。那我就待在这里好了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/f1tpojvo8p6cpw89vai63oe68ufpnir.mp3","text":"如果能一直待在拉特兰吗？执行者的工作也许会很有趣……志愿实践的时候，如果能去公证所实习，说不定也不错。不过，还有更重要的事。同伴们还在等着我们回去。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/91xvtnmftj2438f9knn92p1y45c91iz.mp3","text":"博士，一会儿有空吗？我答应了里凯莱先生和他去新开的餐厅……我们聊到，或许也可以邀请博士一起，听说完成指定套餐的挑战可以免单。你有兴趣吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/22974g7ujmds8vtcr16zbywgfxkldg9.mp3","text":"还好，这个随身听在这里也能工作……博士想听？也可以……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2a/5yvv89cx3vcuk5ut4d1b9eqm8env1e2.mp3","text":"我好像渐渐习惯拉特兰了，现在即使看到人们吃着冰淇淋爆破泡芙雕像也不会惊讶了。也许是因为同伴们在身边，就会安心吧……而且，也遇到了新的同伴。博士，多谢你一直以来的照顾。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/p150s696bwctkqgssk76pqyeqo4bji9.mp3","text":"……拉特兰春天的阳光，把屋子照得暖洋洋的了啊。真舒服呢。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/p282oakkcw8wjj3fgomdgsqf0w52aj7.mp3","text":"我是结城理。刚转学过来，还不太了解情况……请和我讲讲这里的事吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/002w1rjbtd0nkrqczg8c4u60d27ov9k.mp3","text":"博士，不是说看你收藏的电影吗……好多戍卫队，还有铳骑，这些都是真的吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/qo1pu4ch9qrihsut5wu9krvc3z0131v.mp3","text":"我要提前升入高年级了吗……？啊，原来不是。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:1/11/dvw72e72qnexsr4mgihyd7jowei5ved.mp3","text":"这是……成为主力的意思吗？要是之后有机会参加大赛就好了。谢谢你的信任，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/j3lwenxirm0vw7vprwecx1xsce792n2.mp3","text":"战斗训练吗？明白了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/1qxena6lu4qd804ojp6nh84s1dz22ve.mp3","text":"交给我吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/choz6brqjhpblksqvfxfj170n5bno6p.mp3","text":"博士会为我们导航吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/n9i69lu4mqxd6ahwz9ed9imq81vabhj.mp3","text":"博士，拜托了。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/ful5t6okfxexm9f28ybpdjqo9pq7ia0.mp3","text":"那么……","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/4kofmytg5qrvu9kfnlyv6cbuhcb3aqd.mp3","text":"要怎么做。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/dpvszsvbmle6lvwp7j57hvudslr8uoz.mp3","text":"就是这里。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e8/swt9669kas0zm84yy97fy79jagbuzdn.mp3","text":"目前安全。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/5h7y3kfu5tmt60ne9vuhf4i8crlgwpu.mp3","text":"Persona！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/ljtftulcfj1dsjx6n9pncf2jmgao2ub.mp3","text":"来吧！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c8/gdci7tosx85wp6dw166mnt000d83lwe.mp3","text":"不会这样结束！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/t2ggfxadv4pqw7bycfilum7a5mzs0e2.mp3","text":"我……不会逃避！","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/gbf1aik40at770q8xo35pp67urjqpep.mp3","text":"如此艰难的战斗……博士，你似乎也不会恐惧呢。不过，你一定和之前的我不一样吧。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/00/ix1l1jxw0xj2th6r1fbauyz12cuuofv.mp3","text":"赢了。由博士来指挥，就可以专注于战斗了。还不错。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/mwxarbnne7u0xowgu5vnb9de6szma8l.mp3","text":"总觉得还有资源没有收集……博士，确认已经探索完毕了吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/10nphuv42ty0gcbc5t1gzam5tmskgfo.mp3","text":"现在还是撤退吧。勉力战斗可不好。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/qm9c1p7qqem1wm3u85wwdq5t9bydxwq.mp3","text":"我来了。这是博士你要我带的炸弹甜甜圈。……好吃吗？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/aiadxk855apf0gfktlk9ctznwkvp5bd.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a0/i8ey69syq3ecpobe0n97rhrcc80uqwx.mp3","text":"怎么了，博士？","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/ocxqv6fr8lwygi20mlr4mt2my618lqf.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4c/k1nkiyby0vdqlqhlx13n98ogsz48344.mp3","text":"新年快乐，博士。新的一年，如果能再前进一些就好了。你和许多人都在为了某个美好的未来而努力吧……我们也会为此尽力的。今年，也请多关照。","alt":"voice/char_4217_makoto/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/24/ap1gw2dl8ixbq8v3d2vywz3fe5phchf.mp3","text":"老师好……不，博士，你好。","a